The adversarial corpus under corpus/ (its manifest, generators, and the labeled
PDFs produced by `make corpus`) is released under the same Apache-2.0 license so
that others can measure their own document readers against it. Attacks in the
corpus are synthetic and constructed for evaluation; the host documents are
templated, not real contracts.
